  "description": "Dive into the world of freestyle mountain biking with the Steel Reserve Dirt Jumper — built for big tricks, huge airtime, and endless sessions.\nThe new full chromoly frame with a tapered head tube and reinforced tubing strikes the perfect balance between strength and agility. A longer top tube gives you more control, while the short rear end keeps things super nimble. Clean details like integrated cable routing, seat clamp, and chain tensioners keep everything dialed and quiet.\nEquipped with a Marzocchi Bomber DJ, BMX-inspired chromoly components, and a rock-solid spec, the SR is ready for hard landings. Sealed bearings, double-wall rims, and a hydraulic rear disc brake give you the control and confidence to push it.\nReady to go higher? The Haro Steel Reserve is waiting.",
